			(property "Description" "Single Pole, Double Throw (SPDT) Switch\n\nSingle-pole, double-throw (SPDT) switch.\n\nVariant Overview SMD-AYZ0202\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/597 Surface Mount DPDT Switch (COM-00597)\n• Used on e.g. https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12049 LilyPad Arduino USB - ATmega32U4 Board\n\nPTH-11.6X4.0MM\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/102 SPDT Mini Power Switch (COM-00102)\n• Used on e.g. https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10547 SparkFun Simon Says - Through-Hole Soldering Kit (KIT-10547)\n\nPTH-11.6X4.0MM-KIT\n\n• KIT version of SPDT Mini Power Switch - Simplifies soldering by removing tStop of switch pins - only one side can be soldered.\n\nPTH-11.6X4.0MM-LOCK\n\n• LOCK version of SPDT Mini Power Switch - Offset pins hold switch in place for easier soldering.\n\nSMD-RIGHT-ANGLE\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10860 Surface Mount Right Angle Switch (COM-10860)\n• Used on e.g. https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13231 SparkFun ESP8266 Thing"
				(at 0 0 0)
